OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry across the region with
OL,6,Fbright spells today. However, cloud
OL,7,Fwill thicken at times to turn the
OL,8,Fsunshine hazy. Feeling very warm in
OL,9,Fthe sunny spells, particularly across
OL,10,Fthe south.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClear skies at first. Cloud
OL,13,Fwill thicken tonight with outbreaks of
OL,14,Flight rain possibly moving in after
OL,15,Fmidnight. Staying mild under the
OL,16,Fblanket of cloud with a gentle breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
