OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FLargely cloudy at first,
OL,6,Falthough some brighter spells are
OL,7,Flikely during the afternoon. A few
OL,8,Fspots of light rain are possible where
OL,9,Fthe cloud thickens, feeling less humid.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fbut mostly dry on Monday, before a
OL,13,Fband of rain moves through on Tuesday,
OL,14,Fsunny spells and scattered showers on
OL,15,FWednesday. Temperatures around average
OL,16,Ffor the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
